cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Zile onomastice și sărbători românești — Romanian name days and holidays
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it. Attribution is the only condition of
  the licence.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: trends.ro
    website: https://trends.ro
repository-code: https://github.com/rlucian/romanian-name-days
url: https://trends.ro
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable dataset of Romanian name days (zile onomastice) and
  holidays. Covers 86 given names with their diminutives, gender and name-day
  rule, and 35 occasions. Movable feasts are expressed as offsets from Orthodox
  Easter and computed from the Julian computus rather than hardcoded, so the
  dataset resolves correctly for any year. Name-day attributions where Romanian
  sources disagree carry an explicit confidence value and an explanatory note
  instead of a silently chosen date.
keywords:
  - Romania
  - Romanian
  - name days
  - onomastica
  - calendar
  - holidays
  - Orthodox
  - computus
  - open data
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.0.1
date-released: '2026-08-22'
